    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Attacking Ragavan (2/1) into an untapped Endurance (3/4) risks losing Ragavan for free, as Endurance survives the block. The opponent has no reason not to block. Meanwhile, Psychic Frog could have been pumped and given flying (by discarding a card and exiling 3 graveyard cards) to fly over Endurance for damage + card draw, though this would compromise the graveyard count needed for Abhorrent Oculus.",
