    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "With opponent's board tapped out and two ground blockers (Formidable Speaker 2/4, Endurance 3/4) preventing profitable attacks, Qwen3 Vorthos could have discarded a card to pump Psychic Frog and exiled 3 graveyard cards to give it flying, enabling an unblockable 2-damage attack that draws a card. They have 9 graveyard cards and would still retain 6 for Abhorrent Oculus.",
