    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Psychic Frog could have been pumped by discarding a card and given flying (exile 3 cards from graveyard) to attack for 2+ damage through the air and draw a card, since opponent's all lands are tapped and can't interact. With 10 cards in graveyard, flying is available. Discarding Persist (can't be cast this turn anyway with all lands tapped) to pump Frog, then giving it flying for a 2/3 flying attacker that draws on hit seems like good value.",
