    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Fetching basic Island when the hand contains Bitter Triumph and Persist (both requiring {1}{B}) with only one black source (Swamp). A second black source would allow casting both black spells or having redundancy if Swamp gets disrupted. The Island only adds blue mana which Steam Vents already provides.",
