    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Psychic Frog can attack into a completely tapped-out board with no blockers available. The combat damage trigger draws a card, which is pure value. Additionally, Qwen3 could discard a Persist to pump Frog to 2/3, dealing more damage and drawing a card. At 7 life with only 3 cards in hand, the card draw is critically important.",
