      "decision_index": 152,
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Discarding Bitter Triumph (the only removal spell in hand) to pump Psychic Frog loses all interactive capability. At 7 life facing Endurance and Formidable Speaker, having instant-speed removal is valuable. While keeping two Persists enables powerful reanimation (especially Abhorrent Oculus), the second Persist may be redundant given limited black mana sources (only Swamp and Steam Vents).",
