    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Generous Ent costs 6 mana and is slow. Endurance (3 mana, flash, reach) would be cheaper to deploy, can block flying Frogs, and critically its ETB can shuffle the opponent's graveyard - disrupting Psychic Frog's ability to exile cards for flying. Subtlety could also be evoked for free to counter a future creature spell. With 0 cards in hand and needing efficient plays, the expensive Ent is suboptimal.",
