    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "GPT4om Valley attacks with only Shardless Agent (2/2) instead of also sending Endurance (3/4). The opponent is at 7 life with only two 1/2 Psychic Frogs and 1 untapped mana. Attacking with both puts 5 power into combat, forcing the opponent into unfavorable blocks or taking significant damage. Keeping Endurance back as a blocker is unnecessary since two 1/2 Frogs don't threaten meaningful damage against 12 life, especially with only 1 mana available to pump.",
