    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "At 7 life facing lethal (10 damage from Shardless Agent 2/2 + Deceit 5/5 + Endurance 3/4), Qwen3 chose to block Shardless Agent (the smallest attacker) with a Psychic Frog. With two Frogs available as blockers, the optimal assignment is to block the two largest creatures (Deceit and Endurance), taking only 2 damage from Shardless Agent and surviving at 5 life. By blocking Shardless Agent instead, the best remaining assignment has the other Frog on Deceit, taking 3 from Endurance and surviving at 4 life - one unnecessary life point lost.",
